            "review_title": "Review at Tâm Chay Vegan Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Tam Chay\nHanoi, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nMy New Favorite Vegetarian Restaurant in Hà Nội\nAug 2025 • Friends\nTâm Chay is truly a hidden gem for anyone looking for delicious and wholesome vegetarian food in Hà Nội. From the moment you walk in, the peaceful atmosphere and kind, attentive staff make you feel welcomed and relaxed.\n\nThe food is outstanding. Every dish is full of flavor, beautifully presented, and clearly made with fresh ingredients and care. There’s a great variety on the menu, so whether you’re craving a comforting hotpot, a well-balanced mâm cỗ chay, or just a light meal, you’ll find something you love.\n\nEven my friends who usually eat meat were surprised by how satisfying and flavorful everything was. You can really feel the thought and heart put into each dish, which makes the whole experience feel special.\n\nHighly recommend for anyone who values good food and a calm, meaningful dining experience. I will definitely be returning soon and bringing more people with me.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 3, 2025",
